  "clause_1_scope": "This Indian Standard (IS 13725) covers Hexagon Head Screws with Metric Fine Pitch Thread - Product Grades A and B. This Indian Standard ( First Revision ) which is identical with ISO 8676 : 1999 'Hexagon head screws with metric fine pitch thread — Product grades A and B' issued by the International Organization for Standardization ( ISO ) was adopted by the Bolts, Nuts and Fasteners Accessories Sectional Committee and approval of the Basic and Production Engineering Division Council. This standard was originally published in 1993 by adoption of ISO 8676 : 1988. This first revision has been prepared by adoption of the latest version of ISO 8676 published in 1 999. The text of ISO Standard has been approved as suitable for publication as Indian Standard without deviation. Certain terminology and conventions are, however, not identical to those used in Indian Standards. Attention is drawn especially to the following: a) Wherever the words 'International Standard' appear referring to this standard, they should be read as 'Indian Standard'. b) Comma ( , ) has been used as a decimal marker while in India",
